 "notes": [
  "Each channel: Mega pin (2..13) -> blue jumper -> breadboard strip, 220 ohm resistor bridges the centre gap to the LED-anode strip, LED cathode strip is wired by a black jumper to the ground rail (tn). Exact breadboard columns are chosen for a clean layout (2 columns per channel), not copied from the image's hole positions.",
