  "The Mega GND pin (next to AREF) is assumed to be named GND.1 in the catalogue.",
  "LED anodes are the longer leg (A) on the resistor side; cathodes (C) go to ground, as in the schematic.",
  "Image pin order has pin 13 at the leftmost LED; here copy k uses pin k+1, which is electrically equivalent."
